></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/exnes\">exnes</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-16 11:33:53 +08:00\">18h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有总比没有好，但白送的这两个就个人而已开启频率确实低。ATV+一个直连画质不行，代理又费流量。Arc 爱玩游戏的是不错</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18091429\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3eda4ab2251053a7e9e217f3a790c446?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"hunono\" data-uid=\"632255\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>30</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hunono\">hunono</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-16 11:36:38 +08:00\">18h 32m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>iCloud+我的刚需是邮箱绑定个人域名，目前海外最靠谱、最便宜的能绑自己的域名的邮箱了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18091463\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a76b/92f3/519804_normal.png?m=1711520945\" alt=\"tonyer\" data-uid=\"519804\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>31</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tonyer\">tonyer</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-16 11:40:43 +08:00\">18h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>那苹果真是四麻麻了，apple one 续好几年了，还一直涨价，现在说 icloud 包括上 arcade 和 tv 了，那 apple one 价格又不会降半分，真 4000+了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18091601\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/627e/eea7/215669_normal.png?m=1774227938\" alt=\"dcatfly\" data-uid=\"215669\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>32</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dcatfly\">dcatfly</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-16 12:06:38 +08:00\">18h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>国区 iCloud 哭晕在厕所。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18091867\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e956/45ce/233781_normal.png?m=1779448642\" alt=\"rayyume\" data-uid=\"233781\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>33</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/rayyume\">rayyume</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-16 13:44:05 +08:00\">16h 24m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>之前刚从土区换回美区。。又要换回去了。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18092195\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3eda4ab2251053a7e9e217f3a790c446?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"hunono\" data-uid=\"632255\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>37</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hunono\">hunono</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-16 14:43:39 +08:00\">15h 25m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/superhero007\">superhero007</a> 我用了大概 10 年腾讯企业邮箱，后来免费版限制用户数（好像是 5 个），再后来新增邮箱必须绑定微信，不能随时增加新邮箱，我就放弃了，转到了群晖自建邮箱，最近 3 年开始拦截海外邮件，导致部分海外平台的邮件在国内收不到，就换 iCloud 邮箱了，iCloud 邮箱推送也很及时，而且是 apple 自己的推送，稳定可靠。</p>\n              